<navigation-bar title="识别与确认" back="{{false}}" color="#2d2623" background="transparent"><view slot="left" class="nav-circle" bindtap="goBack"><view class="back-icon"></view></view><view slot="right" class="retry-button" bindtap="retry"><view class="retry-icon"></view><text>重拍</text></view></navigation-bar>
<scroll-view class="result-scroll" scroll-y enhanced show-scrollbar="{{false}}" scroll-into-view="{{scrollIntoView}}"><view class="page-shell no-tabs result-page">
  <view class="food-card ui-card"><view class="meal-photo-wrap {{samplePhoto ? 'sample' : ''}}"><image class="meal-photo" src="{{photo}}" mode="{{samplePhoto ? 'heightFix' : 'aspectFill'}}"></image></view><view class="food-list"><text class="food-heading">AI 仅提供候选线索</text><view wx:if="{{!foods.length}}" class="food-empty"><text>{{busy ? '正在识别图片…' : '等待开始识别'}}</text><text>{{busy ? '识别完成后会在这里显示候选食物' : '同意图片处理后点击“开始识别”'}}</text></view><view class="food-row" wx:for="{{foods}}" wx:key="index" bindtap="useCandidate" data-index="{{item.index}}"><view class="food-dot {{item.tone}}">{{item.badge}}</view><view class="food-copy"><text class="food-name">{{item.name}}</text><text class="food-details">{{item.details}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.uncertainty}}" class="food-uncertainty">待确认：{{item.uncertainty}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.mappedName}}" class="food-mapped">已映射：{{item.mappedName}}</text></view></view><view class="reference-note"><view class="info-icon">i</view><text>逐项点击候选，映射并确认实际份量</text></view></view></view>

  <view wx:if="{{!result || errorMessage}}" class="estimate-card ui-card consent-card">
    <text class="section-title">图片处理授权</text>
    <text class="consent-copy">【宝宝营养管家】为识别食物营养成分，需将你拍摄的食物图片发送至 DeepSeek 模型处理。模型通过 API 调用，不将图片用于训练；原始图片仅保存在你的本地终端，服务端只在请求期间临时接触且不保存。图片中的无关人物由 AI Prompt 忽略。不同意不影响基础功能，可继续手工搜索。</text>
    <picker range="{{retentionOptions}}" range-key="label" value="{{retentionIndex}}" bindchange="onRetentionChange"><view class="picker-value">本地期限：{{retentionOptions[retentionIndex].label}}</view></picker>
    <checkbox-group bindchange="onConsentChange"><label class="consent-check"><checkbox value="accepted" checked="{{accepted}}" color="#ff6f70"></checkbox><text>我已知晓并同意上述图片处理</text></label></checkbox-group>
    <button class="primary-button" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="recognize">{{busy ? '处理中' : '开始识别'}}</button><text wx:if="{{errorMessage}}" class="consent-copy">{{errorMessage}}，可继续手工搜索。</text>
  </view>
  <view wx:else class="recognition-status ui-card"><view class="recognition-check"><view class="check-icon"></view></view><view><text>已生成 {{foods.length}} 个候选食物</text><text>图片处理授权已确认，本地保存期限：{{retentionOptions[retentionIndex].label}}</text></view><button bindtap="recognize" loading="{{busy}}">重新识别</button></view>

  <view id="confirm-section" class="estimate-card ui-card">
    <view class="estimate-title"><text class="section-title">确认标准食品与实际摄入</text><view class="info-icon">i</view></view>
    <view class="manual-search"><input value="{{query}}" focus="{{manualFocus}}" bindinput="onQueryInput" bindblur="onManualBlur" placeholder="输入食品名称，或点击上方 AI 候选"></input><button bindtap="searchFood">搜索</button></view>
    <text class="mapping-tip">可逐项确认多种食材，并选择一种份量录入方式。</text>
    <view class="amount-mode-tabs"><view wx:for="{{amountModes}}" wx:key="value" class="amount-mode-tab {{amountMode === item.value ? 'active' : ''}}" data-mode="{{item.value}}" bindtap="selectAmountMode">{{item.label}}</view></view>
    <view wx:if="{{amountMode === 'RATIO'}}" class="meal-total-row"><view><text>本餐实际摄入总量</text><text>按每种食材占比自动换算克数</text></view><view class="meal-total-input"><input type="digit" value="{{mealTotalAmount}}" bindinput="onMealTotalInput" placeholder="例如500"></input><text>克</text></view></view>
    <view class="confirmed-list">
      <view class="confirmed-food" wx:for="{{confirmedFoods}}" wx:key="localId">
        <view class="confirmed-heading"><view><text class="confirmed-name">{{item.canonicalNameZh}}</text><text class="observed-name">识别线索：{{item.observedName}}</text></view><text class="remove-food" bindtap="removeFood" data-index="{{index}}">移除</text></view>
        <view wx:if="{{amountMode === 'MANUAL'}}" class="amount-row"><input type="digit" value="{{item.servedAmount}}" bindinput="onServedInput" data-index="{{index}}" placeholder="端上桌克数（可选）"></input><input type="digit" value="{{item.consumedAmount}}" bindinput="onConsumedInput" data-index="{{index}}" placeholder="实际吃下克数（必填）"></input></view>
        <view wx:elif="{{amountMode === 'SLIDER'}}" class="slider-editor"><view class="slider-summary"><text>实际吃下</text><text>{{item.consumedAmount || 0}} 克</text></view><slider min="0" max="500" step="1" value="{{item.consumedAmount || 0}}" activeColor="#ff6f70" backgroundColor="#efe8e3" block-color="#ff6f70" block-size="22" data-index="{{index}}" bindchanging="onConsumedSliderChange" bindchange="onConsumedSliderChange"/><view class="served-inline"><text>端上桌（可选）</text><input type="digit" value="{{item.servedAmount}}" bindinput="onServedInput" data-index="{{index}}" placeholder="克数"></input><text>克</text></view></view>
        <view wx:else class="slider-editor"><view class="slider-summary"><text>占本餐实际摄入</text><text>{{item.ratioPercent}}% · {{item.consumedAmount || 0}} 克</text></view><slider min="0" max="100" step="1" value="{{item.ratioPercent}}" activeColor="#ffad3d" backgroundColor="#efe8e3" block-color="#ffad3d" block-size="22" data-index="{{index}}" bindchanging="onRatioSliderChange" bindchange="onRatioSliderChange"/></view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{amountMode === 'RATIO' && confirmedFoods.length}}" class="ratio-total {{ratioTotal === 100 ? 'valid' : ''}}"><text>食材占比合计</text><text>{{ratioTotal}}%{{ratioTotal === 100 ? '，可保存' : '，请调整为100%'}}</text></view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{nutrition.length}}" class="estimate-card ui-card"><view class="estimate-title"><text class="section-title">确定性营养参考</text><view class="info-icon">i</view></view><view class="nutrition-grid"><view class="nutrition-cell" wx:for="{{nutrition}}" wx:key="name"><text class="nutrition-name">{{item.name}}</text><view class="nutrition-badge {{item.tone}}">{{item.badge}}</view><text class="nutrition-value">{{item.value}}</text></view></view><view class="estimate-foot"><text>数据覆盖率 {{coverageText}}；缺失值不按零处理</text><text wx:for="{{warnings}}" wx:key="*this">{{item}}</text></view></view>
  <view class="evaluation-card ui-card"><text class="evaluation-heading">使用边界</text><view class="evaluation-panel"><view><text>图片识别只产生候选，不产生营养事实。</text><text>食材、端上桌份量和实际吃下克数均由照护者确认。</text><text>结果仅供内部学习参考，不是医学诊断或喂养处方。</text></view></view></view>
</view></scroll-view>
<view class="result-actions safe-fixed"><button class="secondary-button" bindtap="startManualSearch">手工添加食物</button><button class="primary-button" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="save"><view wx:if="{{!busy}}" class="check-circle"><view class="check-icon"></view></view><text>{{busy ? '正在保存' : '确认并保存记录'}}</text></button></view>
